        "input": "customers = [1, 0, 1, 2, 1, 1, 7, 5], grumpy = [0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 1], minutes = 3",
        "output": "16",
        "expectedOutput": "16",
        "explanation": "using the technique on the last 3 minutes turns the grumpy minutes there into satisfied customers"
      },
      {
